{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/gethomedir()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/getHomeDir()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Gets the current user’s home directory.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"func","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"getHomeDir","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"roleHeading":"Function","externalID":"s:4GLib10getHomeDirSSSgyF","title":"getHomeDir()"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getHomeDir","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As with most UNIX tools, this function will return the value of the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HOME"},{"text":" environment variable if it is set to an existing absolute path","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name, falling back to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"passwd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file in the case that it is unset.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the path given in ","type":"text"},{"code":"HOME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is non-absolute, does not exist, or is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not a directory, the result is undefined.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before version 2.36 this function would ignore the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HOME"},{"type":"text","text":" environment"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variable, taking the value from the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"passwd"},{"text":" database instead. This was","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"changed to increase the compatibility of GLib with other programs (and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the XDG basedir specification) and to increase testability of programs","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"based on GLib (by making it easier to run them from test frameworks)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If your program has a strong requirement for either the new or the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"old behaviour (and if you don’t wish to increase your GLib","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dependency to ensure that the new behaviour is in effect) then you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"should either directly check the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HOME"},{"type":"text","text":" environment variable yourself"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or unset it before calling any functions in GLib."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/getHomeDir()":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Gets the current user’s home directory.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/glib\/gethomedir()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"getHomeDir"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/getHomeDir()","title":"getHomeDir()"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","title":"GLib","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"}}}